//------------------------------------------------------------------------
//                       THE FINAL BUNKER
//------------------------------------------------------------------------
title: TheFinalBunker
---
The door is open so you go in
<<complete_and_hide "QuestTitleEnding" 2>>
<<show_text "EndingCanvas">>
<<disable_controls "Player">>

There are a couple of people already there
People whisper. Someone is praying.
Seems like someone lives here and is not happy

Grumpy Resident: Shouldn't have opened the door!

<<wait 3>>
You wait for a bit and nothing happens
...
...
<<stop_audio "NatureSound">>
Someone: It’s coming…
<<play_audio "MeteorSound">>

<<wait 10>>

<<show_text "EndingMenuPanel">>
===

//------------------------------------------------------------------------
//                        ENDING SYSTEM
//------------------------------------------------------------------------
title: EndingSystem
---
You got xx good points
You got xx bad points

<<if $goodPoints > $badPoints>>
	<<jump Heaven>>
<<elseif $badPoints > $goodPoints>>
	<<jump Hell>>
<<else>>
	<<jump Purgatory>>
<<endif>>
